WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.821 --> 00:00:16.746
Gildong returned to the temple with a large party of servants.

2
00:00:20.087 --> 00:00:21.948
The head monk was there to greet him.

3
00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:24.789
"I've had a long journey.

4
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.631
I'm very hungry from my travels," Gildong said.

5
00:00:29.611 --> 00:00:31.032
The head monk smiled.

6
00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:35.466
"We have prepared a feast for you."

7
00:00:35.486 --> 00:00:39.267
"Good," Gildong said.

8
00:00:39.287 --> 00:00:41.568
"Please gather all the monks."

9
00:00:41.588 --> 00:00:47.591
"Of course, young master," the monk said.

10
00:00:47.611 --> 00:00:52.393
"Everything is exactly as you requested.

11
00:00:53.314 --> 00:00:57.416
The monks in this temple are gathering right now."

12
00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:06.753
The head monk took Gildong and his servants to a large pavilion.

13
00:01:07.813 --> 00:01:09.994
Dishes of food filled the tables.

14
00:01:11.014 --> 00:01:13.515
All the monks were gathered, waiting for Gildong.

15
00:01:14.575 --> 00:01:17.676
The head monk led Gildong to the seat of honor.

16
00:01:17.696 --> 00:01:21.917
"What a wonderful feast!"

17
00:01:22.277 --> 00:01:23.118
Gildong said.

18
00:01:23.138 --> 00:01:25.438
"Let's eat and be merry!"

19
00:01:27.739 --> 00:01:29.199
Everyone ate and drank.

20
00:01:30.339 --> 00:01:32.040
The monks joked and laughed.

21
00:01:33.368 --> 00:01:35.089
Gildong watched the party.

22
00:01:38.952 --> 00:01:41.734
After a while the monks began to look tired.

23
00:01:41.754 --> 00:01:46.077
"Now seems like a good time," he thought.

24
00:01:47.218 --> 00:01:50.760
When no one was looking, Gildong reached into his sleeve.

25
00:01:52.322 --> 00:01:54.523
He sprinkled some sand on his rice.

26
00:01:56.464 --> 00:01:59.026
Then he put a spoonful into his mouth.

27
00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:04.529
Crack! All the monks stared at him.

28
00:02:04.549 --> 00:02:07.190
"Ahh! Ouch!

29
00:02:07.691 --> 00:02:08.471
My teeth!"

30
00:02:08.891 --> 00:02:10.212
he cried loudly.

31
00:02:11.473 --> 00:02:12.873
He spat out the rice.

32
00:02:15.715 --> 00:02:17.316
The head monk looked shocked.

33
00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:20.978
"I'm very sorry, young master.

34
00:02:21.858 --> 00:02:23.439
What is the problem?"

35
00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:28.002
Gildong pretended to look carefully at the bowl.

36
00:02:28.022 --> 00:02:30.643
"There's sand in the rice!"

37
00:02:31.063 --> 00:02:31.704
he cried.

38
00:02:33.044 --> 00:02:34.225
"You all eat with greed.

39
00:02:35.186 --> 00:02:37.167
Yet you serve sand to your guests?"

40
00:02:39.049 --> 00:02:41.171
The head monk's face turned pale.

41
00:02:42.292 --> 00:02:44.353
He shook with fear and bowed.

42
00:02:44.373 --> 00:02:53.541
"Young master, I have no idea how—" "You must be punished for your disrespect," Gildong snapped.

43
00:02:54.782 --> 00:02:56.223
He turned to his servants.

44
00:02:56.243 --> 00:02:58.144
"Tie them all up!"

45
00:03:00.826 --> 00:03:06.031
"Yes, young master," Mok said, grabbing the head monk by his robe.

46
00:03:10.534 --> 00:03:12.536
Soon all the monks were tied up.

47
00:03:13.977 --> 00:03:16.039
"Everyone, to the storeroom!"

48
00:03:16.639 --> 00:03:17.440
Mok shouted.

49
00:03:18.641 --> 00:03:21.263
Gildong's servants took off their disguises.

50
00:03:24.085 --> 00:03:26.047
The head monk's eyes narrowed.

51
00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:29.169
"You'll pay for this!"

52
00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.412
More thieves rushed into the temple.

53
00:03:34.112 --> 00:03:35.853
They all headed to the storeroom.

54
00:03:38.755 --> 00:03:41.257
It was filled with grain and valuables.

55
00:03:44.359 --> 00:03:47.501
As they loaded up carts, the bandits cheered.

56
00:03:53.085 --> 00:03:55.046
A young monk approached the temple.

57
00:03:56.748 --> 00:03:59.790
He was coming back from an errand in a faraway town.

58
00:04:01.091 --> 00:04:02.732
Suddenly he heard shouting.

59
00:04:04.428 --> 00:04:05.389
"What's going on?"

60
00:04:05.689 --> 00:04:06.229
he thought.

61
00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:08.771
He peeked into the temple.

62
00:04:12.313 --> 00:04:15.394
He saw strange men carrying sacks of grain.

63
00:04:16.615 --> 00:04:18.196
Some held rolls of silk.

64
00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:21.258
The young monk gasped.

65
00:04:22.218 --> 00:04:24.539
"Bandits are robbing the temple!

66
00:04:24.579 --> 00:04:25.320
I must get help!"
